{"Title":"An Act increasing accessibility in restaurants for physically handicapped persons","BillNumber":"S112","DocketNumber":"SD2037","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JBL0","Name":"Joan B. Lovely","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JBL0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T12:16:10.563"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":null,"Name":"Catherine Fritz","Type":3,"Details":null,"ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T12:16:10.58"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S112/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Ms. Lovely (by request), a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 112) of Catherine Fritz for legislation to increase accessibility in restaurants for physically handicapped persons.  Children, Families and Persons with Disabilities.","DocumentText":"\tSection 13A of the General Laws is hereby amended by inserting, after the eighth paragraph, the following:-\r\n\tAny restaurants, including but not limited to, cafeterias, lounges, bars and other places open to the public where food or beverages are served are required to have at least 5% of the chairs be armchairs or have them available on-site upon request.   \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J13","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J13"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}